{"4262620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Alighieri Circle: Dante's Bloodline", "steam_appid": 4262620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>The Descent Begins</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/f4acbb4efc8d4c680ddae7948ff86ae1.avif?t=1787815540\" width=1200 height=376 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/2f9a715218ce0679b95737f679efa548.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell</strong> is not a place of fire; it is a <strong>mirror of your soul.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Alighieri Circle</strong>, you are <strong>Gabriele Alighieri.</strong> You are not a soldier, nor a hero. Only a man crushed by a legacy you never asked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/8a6d859716c569de36ddc89d1248487b.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 33 years the barrier between our reality and the Hell fades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your family and the world you know, you must perform <strong>The Ritual</strong>, returning to your ancestral home and accept a destiny you have spent your life running from. In first-person psychological thriller focused on atmosphere, exploration, and story. There is no combat; only the tension of the unknown. Immerse yourself in a dark, modern interpretation of the Divine Comedy, where the Inferno is a shadow waiting to consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/a57435586eab9c9c5efbb8179fcdeaeb.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ritual requires you to navigate two converging realities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villa</strong>: Explore the silent, melancholic halls of the Italian manor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dive</strong>: Cross the threshold into a distorted reflection of the infernal depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/92dc6222408a40c5427f46b3c7d2ade6.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Quest for the Infernal Seal</strong>: Gather the lost, magical pages of the Divine Comedy and reunite them to perform the ritual that keeps the gates of Hell sealed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Puzzle Solving</strong>: Decipher esoteric riddles and navigate a harrowing psychological journey that forces you to confront Gabriele's deepest fears and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth a Fragmented Truth</strong>: Scour the environment to find hidden collectibles and diary pages. Piece together the tragic history of the Alighieri bloodline and the forgotten memories of Gabriele’s life to understand the true cost of the Ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/44456ea90d92503a7cc31e34b74864e8.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=198 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/2f9a715218ce0679b95737f679efa548.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell</strong> is not a place of fire; it is a <strong>mirror of your soul.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Alighieri Circle</strong>, you are <strong>Gabriele Alighieri.</strong> You are not a soldier, nor a hero. Only a man crushed by a legacy you never asked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/8a6d859716c569de36ddc89d1248487b.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 33 years the barrier between our reality and the Hell fades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your family and the world you know, you must perform <strong>The Ritual</strong>, returning to your ancestral home and accept a destiny you have spent your life running from. In first-person psychological thriller focused on atmosphere, exploration, and story. There is no combat; only the tension of the unknown. Immerse yourself in a dark, modern interpretation of the Divine Comedy, where the Inferno is a shadow waiting to consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/05a6b564f651e3ec1fa1ec1d2ad5537c.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/a57435586eab9c9c5efbb8179fcdeaeb.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ritual requires you to navigate two converging realities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Villa</strong>: Explore the silent, melancholic halls of the Italian manor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dive</strong>: Cross the threshold into a distorted reflection of the infernal depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/e280f4de08dd8ffa22aa185b8ece607a.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/92dc6222408a40c5427f46b3c7d2ade6.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=199 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Quest for the Infernal Seal</strong>: Gather the lost, magical pages of the Divine Comedy and reunite them to perform the ritual that keeps the gates of Hell sealed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Puzzle Solving</strong>: Decipher esoteric riddles and navigate a harrowing psychological journey that forces you to confront Gabriele's deepest fears and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth a Fragmented Truth</strong>: Scour the environment to find hidden collectibles and diary pages. Piece together the tragic history of the Alighieri bloodline and the forgotten memories of Gabriele’s life to understand the true cost of the Ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.poster.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.webm?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/4a7863d01b02c22c5727be5ead226d30.mp4?t=1787815540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/extras/44456ea90d92503a7cc31e34b74864e8.avif?t=1787815540\" width=780 height=198 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The world knows the Divine Comedy as a poem. For your family, it is a prison. As Gabriele Alighieri, you inherit a duty: reseal the gates of Hell. Burdened by fate, you descend into a psychological nightmare where the only escape is to uncover the dark secrets of your ancestors.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“You'll slowly uncover the truth about the Alighieri bloodline, all in a tense atmosphere and an environment that reacts to your internal state of mind. I'm intrigued by this new interpretation of such a classic piece of literature as The Divine Comedy.”<br>TechRadar<br><br>“It's a harrowing psychological journey through melancholy that weaves in creative references from The Divine Comedy into its puzzles and environmental storytelling.”<br>Windows Central<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/9f2e8264f3b44e347908b77331cf36ce63cb7fe9/header.jpg?t=1787815540", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/2219d7d2ca5a81e653b5aff117c99240777f4ece/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787815540", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262620/2219d7d2ca5a81e653b5aff117c99240777f4ece/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787815540", "website": "https://entaltostudios.com/the-alighieri-circle/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4690 | AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB | AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7 8700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 | RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright © 2026 Publishe